    "notes": [
      "INCOMPLETE DRAFT. Not VehicleHub-ready and refused by the firmware apply path (status draft).",
      "Only group membership and standard-PID field names are evidenced. Polling periods, group init strings, ECU headers, OBD protocol and CAN bitrate are unknown and deliberately omitted.",
      "Every field name is a firmware standard-PID name (main/obd2_standard_pids.h, format %02X-<name>); the request is 01 + the PID byte and the decoding is the firmware's standard table.",
      "The registry lists oxygen-sensor detail PIDs only as wildcards (24-*, 28-*, 38-*); the exact parameter names are unknown and are not included.",
      "9D-EngineFuelRate was always 0 in production data (VehicleHub 2026-08-06 fuel-cut readiness audit) and is observe-only.",
